---

<section class="how-i-lead" id="how-i-lead">
  <div class="band-content">
    <h2 class="mono">How I Lead</h2>
    <p class="display">
      Clarity from ambiguity. <span class="emphasis">Autonomous Designers.</span> Reusable
      foundations. <span class="emphasis">Design that ships.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-i-lead {
    background: var(--band-bg);
    color: var(--band-fg);
  }

  .how-i-lead .band-content {
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .how-i-lead h2 {
    color: var(--band-eyebrow);
  }

  .how-i-lead p {
    font-size: var(--fs-statement);
    line-height: 1.1;
    /* Matches the design's 1280px column so the lines break the same way on wide screens. */
    max-width: 80rem;
  }

  /* Teal on the dark band; raspberry in dark mode, where the band is cream. */
  .emphasis {
    color: var(--band-eyebrow);
  }
</style>
